<section class="bg-brand-lavenderBg py-20 lg:py-24 border-b border-brand-forest/10 text-brand-forest">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-brand-teal mb-2">Systems Curation</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-forest font-sans tracking-tight">
        Engineered &amp; Audited by a Solo AI Systems Specialist
      </h2>
      <p class="text-brand-forest/80 font-medium text-base leading-relaxed mt-4">
        Directories that scrape GitHub READMEs lack depth. As an ambitious Software and Electrical Engineer with hands-on experience in building AI models and local systems, I manually audit and execute every single tool listed here on bare metal.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white border border-brand-forest/10 rounded-4xl p-8 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between text-brand-forest">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-brand-tealLight border border-brand-teal/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden mb-5">
            <svg class="w-14 h-14 text-brand-teal" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="16" fill="none" stroke="#05B2A3" stroke-width="1.8" />
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="6" fill="#C5F82A" />
              <path d="M50 10v24M50 66v24M10 50h24M66 50h24" stroke="#05B2A3" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-brand-indigoLight border border-brand-indigo/10 text-brand-indigo text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full mb-3 shadow-sm">
            Electrical &amp; Systems Engineer
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-forest font-sans">Mamy</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted font-bold mb-4">Independent Registry Creator</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Combining hardware limits (registers, silicon caching architectures, electrical limits) with deep learning workflows (quantized matrices, model tensors, pipeline runtimes).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-brand-forest/10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-muted uppercase tracking-wider">benchmarking targets:</span>
          <span class="inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 bg-brand-bg border border-brand-forest/10 text-xs font-bold rounded-md">RTX CUDA</span>
          <span class="inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 bg-brand-tealLight border border-brand-forest/10 text-xs font-bold rounded-md">M1/M2/M3</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4 text-brand-forest">
        <div class="card-hover bg-white border border-brand-forest/10 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-tealLight border border-brand-teal/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm text-brand-teal shrink-0">⚡</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-sans font-bold text-lg text-brand-forest mb-1">Hardware &amp; Electrical Audits</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">I benchmark token/sec generation rates relative to GPU memory bandwidth limitations, shared system RAM on unified silicon boards, and thermals to document exact minimal hardware bounds.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-hover bg-white border border-brand-forest/10 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-bg border border-brand-forest/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm text-brand-forest shrink-0">💻</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-sans font-bold text-lg text-brand-forest mb-1">Software Configuration Audits</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">I examine packaging builds—evaluating containerization configs (Docker, K8s), shared memory limits, local socket APIs, and bare-metal compilation logs to ensure secure integrations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-hover bg-white border border-brand-forest/10 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-tealLight border border-brand-teal/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm text-brand-teal shrink-0">🛡️</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-sans font-bold text-lg text-brand-forest mb-1">AI Systems Telemetry Audits</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">I run packet-sniffer monitoring tasks on the host nodes to verify that models, dependencies, and UIs make zero outbound server requests when configured to run in isolated states.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>